# AI candidates awaiting human review. Runtime state, not source: a candidate either gets
# promoted into tests/e2e/<feature>/ on approval (properly tracked there) or stays rejected —
# never committed as-is. Without this, any git add -A after a manual pipeline run risks sweeping
# up whatever candidate happens to be sitting here.
packages/e2e-framework/tests/generated/*
!packages/e2e-framework/tests/generated/.gitkeep
